\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
Develop a reliable workflow that translates AI-generated mathematical arguments into Lean, checks every inferential detail, and diagnoses gaps rather than accepting persuasive but invalid prose. Determine how much of this verification and repair process can itself be automated. \href{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2025/43}{[S2]}
